{"seq":1,"slug":"agricultural-biotechnology","title":"农业生物技术","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology","introMarkdown":"# 农业生物技术 简介\n\n农业生物技术是现代农业科学的前沿领域，将分子生物学、遗传学和生物工程的理论与方法应用于作物改良、畜牧生产和农业资源开发。这一学科在保障全球粮食安全、提升农产品品质和推动绿色农业发展中扮演着不可替代的角色。\n\n本课程围绕农业生物技术的四个核心方向展开，帮助学习者建立从基础理论到前沿应用的完整知识框架。\n\n第一章**植物生物技术**聚焦于植物分子育种的关键手段，包括转基因作物的构建原理、分子标记辅助选择在传统育种中的革新，以及以CRISPR为代表的基因组编辑技术为植物遗传改良带来的全新可能。\n\n第二章**动物生物技术**探讨动物遗传资源的深度开发与利用，涵盖基因组学在动物育种中的应用、体细胞核移植等克隆技术的原理与进展，以及生物技术在水产养殖领域的实践。\n\n第三章**微生物生物技术**关注农业微生物资源的挖掘与利用，从土壤微生物组的功能解析到生物防治制剂的开发，再到发酵工程在农产品加工中的应用，呈现微生物在农业系统中的多维价值。\n\n第四章**生物安全与伦理**从社会治理的视角审视农业生物技术的风险与规范，讨论转基因生物的安全监管框架、环境风险评估方法以及农业生物伦理的基本原则与争议。\n\n建议学习者先掌握分子生物学和遗传学基础，再按章节顺序深入各专题。每一方向既有独立的研究范式，又与其他方向紧密关联，系统学习有助于全面把握农业生物技术的发展脉络和实际应用。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"plant-biotech","title":"植物生物技术","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/plant-biotech","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transgenic-crops","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 转基因作物","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/plant-biotech/transgenic-crops"},{"seq":2,"slug":"marker-assisted-selection","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 分子标记辅助选择","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/plant-biotech/marker-assisted-selection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"genome-editing-plants","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 植物基因组编辑","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/plant-biotech/genome-editing-plants"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"animal-biotech","title":"动物生物技术","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/animal-biotech","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"animal-breeding-genomics","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 动物育种基因组学","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/animal-biotech/animal-breeding-genomics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cloning-technology","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 动物克隆技术","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/animal-biotech/cloning-technology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"aquaculture-biotech","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 水产养殖生物技术","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/animal-biotech/aquaculture-biotech"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"microbial-biotech","title":"微生物生物技术","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/microbial-biotech","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"soil-microbiome","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 土壤微生物组","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/microbial-biotech/soil-microbiome"},{"seq":2,"slug":"biocontrol-agents","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 生物防治制剂","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/microbial-biotech/biocontrol-agents"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fermentation-technology","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 发酵工程技术","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/microbial-biotech/fermentation-technology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"biosafety","title":"生物安全与伦理","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/biosafety","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gmo-regulation","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 转基因生物安全监管","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/biosafety/gmo-regulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"environmental-risk-assessment","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 环境风险评估","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/biosafety/environmental-risk-assessment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bioethics-agriculture","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 农业生物伦理","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/biosafety/bioethics-agriculture"}]}]}